glossary_entry 雷辰 {"count":1,"next":null,"previous":null,"first":"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/glossary_entry?name=%E9%9B%B7%E8%BE%B0&offset=0&limit=100&expand=true","last":"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/glossary_entry?name=%E9%9B%B7%E8%BE%B0&offset=0&limit=100&expand=true","results":[{"id":444,"name":"雷辰","desc":"雷辰被点亮时，将会与上一个已点亮的雷辰相连；当自身点亮四颗雷辰时，若连接的雷辰呈“ㄣ”形则回合结束后自身解除所处的异常状态与能力下降状态并进入3回合的觉醒状态，否则恢复自身全部体力值并重置自身的雷辰进度","kind":1,"link":[{"id":445,"url":"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/glossary_entry/445"}],"pet":[{"id":4765,"url":"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/pet/4765"}],"hash":"23097e0d"}],"hash":"ec45abf6"}
